---
import StorefrontLayout from '../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout
  title="Our Thesis"
  description="How Symeno leverages volume to collapse retail margins."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-base">
    <section
      class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-outline py-24 md:py-32"
    >
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-0 h-[500px] w-[500px] rounded-full bg-brand opacity-[0.03] blur-[100px]"
      >
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <span
          class="mb-6 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase"
          >The Symeno Thesis</span
        >
        <h1
          class="mb-8 text-4xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tighter text-content md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
        >
          Retail margins are a tax on the uninformed. <span
            class="text-content-muted">We refuse to pay it.</span 
          >
        </h1>
        <div
          class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted"
        >
          <p>
            Symeno wasn't built by traditional retailers. We are a team of data
            analysts, hardware enthusiasts, and supply chain operators who got tired 
            of watching businesses and consumers get price-gouged for premium tech.
          </p>
          <p>
            The global commerce system is broken. Every time a product moves from a 
            manufacturer to a regional distributor, and finally to a shiny retail storefront, 
            a new margin is slapped on top. By the time you buy it, you're paying for 
            their expensive real estate, massive ad budgets, and bloated operations.
          </p>
          <p class="font-medium text-content">
            We engineered a bypass. We leverage global arbitrage to secure premium 
            hardware at wholesale rates, and we pass the delta directly to you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-16 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24">
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
            <h2 class="mb-12 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-content">
              How the math actually works.
            </h2>

            <div class="relative space-y-12 border-l border-outline pl-8">
              <div class="relative">
                <span
                  class="absolute top-1 -left-[37px] h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--color-brand)]"
                ></span>
                <span
                  class="mb-2 block font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content"
                  >01</span
                >
                <h3
                  class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-content uppercase"
                >
                  Volume Aggregation
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
                  We don't buy singles. We pool capital to execute massive wholesale orders directly
                  with authorized Tier-1 distributors. This grants us volume pricing tiers completely 
                  inaccessible to standard retail chains.  
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <span
                  class="absolute top-1 -left-[37px] h-2 w-2 rounded-full border border-outline bg-surface"
                ></span>
                <span
                  class="mb-2 block font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content"
                  >02</span
                >
                <h3
                  class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-content uppercase"
                >
                  Zero Bloat
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
                  No physical storefronts. No commissioned salespeople. Our
                  operations are entirely cloud-based, highly automated, and ruthlessly efficient. 
                  Because our overhead is almost zero, we don't need a 40% markup to survive.  
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <span
                  class="absolute top-1 -left-[37px] h-2 w-2 rounded-full border border-outline bg-surface"
                ></span>
                <span
                  class="mb-2 block font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content"
                  >03</span
                >
                <h3
                  class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-content uppercase"
                >
                  Margin Compression
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
                  We take a flat, sustainable fractional margin on our wholesale
                  cost. That's it. The entire remaining delta between our cost and the standard 
                  retail price stays exactly where it belongs: in your bank account.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div
            class="flex flex-col justify-center border border-outline bg-surface p-8 shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] md:p-12"  
          >
            <h3 class="mb-8 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-content">
              Corporate Integrity
            </h3>

            <ul class="space-y-6 font-mono text-sm">
              <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline pb-4">
                <span class="text-content-muted uppercase">Legal Entity</span>
                <span class="text-right text-content">SYMENO LLC<br /><span class="text-[10px] text-content-muted">Founded 2026 &middot; Sheridan, Wyoming</span></span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline pb-4">
                <span class="text-content-muted uppercase">Inventory Status</span
                >
                <span class="text-right text-brand"
                  >100% Owned & Stocked<br /><span
                    class="text-[10px] text-content-muted"
                    >(Zero Dropshipping)</span
                  ></span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline pb-4">
                <span class="text-content-muted uppercase"
                  >Payment Protocol</span
                >
                <span class="text-right text-content"
                  >Stripe (PCI DSS Level 1)</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex justify-between pb-2">
                <span class="text-content-muted uppercase"
                  >Our Guarantee</span
                >
                <span class="text-right text-content"
                  >30-Day Hassle-Free Returns<br />100% Authenticity Verified</span   
                >
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="mt-12 border-t border-outline pt-8">
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-content-muted italic">
                "Trust isn't given; it's executed. We don't ask you to trust our marketing copy—we ask you to verify our prices and our shipping speeds. The data speaks for itself."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>